Working: Old Ratio — Tarun:Abhishek:Kamal:Vivek = 5:3:2:2. New Ratio — Tarun:Abhishek:Vivek = 1:1:1.
Gaining Share of Tarun = New Share − Old Share = 1/3 − 5/12 = (−)1/12 {sacrifice}
Gaining Share of Abhishek = 1/3 − 3/12 = 1/12 {gain}
Gaining Share of Vivek = 1/3 − 2/12 = 2/12 {gain}
Kamal's share of Goodwill = 2/12 × 9,00,000 = ₹1,50,000
